  "id": "NPCI-UPI-MASK-IDENTIFIERS",
  "title": "UPI IDs, mobile numbers and account numbers masked to users",
  "obligation": "UPI Member Banks and UPI Apps must mask UPI IDs, mobile numbers and account numbers across all customer-facing interfaces and communications, in the masking format given in the circular.",
